Problem: Minimum Size Subarray Sum (LC 209)

Pattern: Variable Size Sliding Window

Approach:

Initialize left = 0, sum = 0, and ans = INT_MAX.
Expand the window by adding nums[right] to sum.
While sum >= target:
Update the minimum length using min(ans, right - left + 1).
Remove nums[left] from sum.
Move left forward.
If ans is still INT_MAX, no valid subarray exists, so return 0.
Otherwise, return ans.

Time Complexity: O(n)

Space Complexity: O(1)